   ================================================== */

/*
  Express server that exposes:
   - POST /api/get-layer    -> returns Earth Engine tile URL for a polygon + layer
   - POST /api/get-stats    -> enqueues NDVI time-series job (returns job id)
   - GET  /api/job/:id      -> job status/result

